      "---",
      "",
      "## Day 24：SQLAlchemy ORM",
      "",
      "ORM（Object-Relational Mapping）让你用 **Python 类** 来操作数据库——不需要写 SQL，只需要操作对象。",
      "",
      "### ORM 的核心思想",
      "",
      "```",
      "数据库表              Python 类",
      "authors 表  ────→  class Author(Base):",
      "  id                  id = Column(Integer, primary_key=True)",
      "  name                name = Column(String)",
      "  bio                 bio = Column(String)",
      "",
      "数据库行              Python 对象",
      "authors 的一行  ──→  Author(name='刘慈欣', bio='科幻作家')",
      "```",
      "",
      "### 优势",
      "- 不用写 SQL（数据库无关性）",
      "- 类型安全（列类型在 Python 中有对应）",
      "- 关系导航（`author.books` 直接访问关联数据）",
      "- 自动管理关系（级联操作）",
      "",
      "### 劣势",
      "- 复杂查询写起来比原生 SQL 啰嗦",
      "- 性能调优需要理解背后的 SQL 生成",
      "- 学习曲线——ORM 是给会 SQL 的人用的"
    ]
  },
  {
    "cell_id": "cell-14",
    "cell_type": "code",
    "source": [
      "# Day 24：SQLAlchemy ORM 模型定义",
      "",
      "from sqlalchemy import create_engine, Column, Integer, String, Float, Date, ForeignKey, Text",
      "from sqlalchemy.orm import DeclarativeBase, relationship, Session",
      "from datetime import date",
      "",
      "# 新建一个 schema 用于 ORM 演示",
      "!docker exec pg-learn psql -U postgres -d learn -c \"CREATE SCHEMA IF NOT EXISTS orm_demo;\"",
      "",
      "# 创建引擎",
      "engine = create_engine(",
      "    \"postgresql+psycopg2://postgres:secret@localhost:5432/learn\",",
      "    echo=False",
      ")",
      "",
      "# 声明基类",
      "class Base(DeclarativeBase):",
      "    pass",
      "",
      "# 定义映射",
      "class Author(Base):",
      "    __tablename__ = \"authors\"",
      "    __table_args__ = {\"schema\": \"orm_demo\"}",
      "",
      "    id = Column(Integer, primary_key=True)",
      "    name = Column(String(200), nullable=False)",
      "    bio = Column(Text)",
      "",
      "    # 关系：Author.books → Book.author",
      "    books = relationship(\"Book\", back_populates=\"author\")",
      "",
      "    def __repr__(self):",
      "        return f\"<Author(id={self.id}, name='{self.name}')>\"",
      "",
      "",
      "class Book(Base):",
      "    __tablename__ = \"books\"",
      "    __table_args__ = {\"schema\": \"orm_demo\"}",
      "",
      "    id = Column(Integer, primary_key=True)",
      "    title = Column(String(300), nullable=False)",
      "    price = Column(Float)",
      "    author_id = Column(Integer, ForeignKey(\"orm_demo.authors.id\"))",
      "",
      "    author = relationship(\"Author\", back_populates=\"books\")",
      "",
      "    def __repr__(self):",
      "        return f\"<Book(title='{self.title}', price={self.price})>\"",
      "",
      "",
      "# 创建表",
      "Base.metadata.create_all(engine)",
      "print(\"表已创建！\")"
    ]
  },
