      "---",
      "",
      "## Day 25：Alembic — 数据库迁移",
      "",
      "### 为什么需要 Migration？",
      "",
      "团队开发中，每个人的本地数据库 schema 可能不一样。Alembic 帮你：",
      "- **版本控制**数据库 schema（像 Git 管理代码一样）",
      "- **自动迁移**：模型变了，自动生成 ALTER TABLE 脚本",
      "- **可回滚**：`alembic downgrade -1` 回到上一个版本",
      "",
      "### 工作流",
      "",
      "```",
      "修改模型 -> alembic revision --autogenerate -m \"说明\"",
      "          -> 检查生成的迁移脚本",
      "          -> alembic upgrade head",
      "```"
    ]
  },
  {
    "cell_id": "cell-19",
    "cell_type": "code",
    "source": [
      "# Day 25：初始化 Alembic",
      "!cd /tmp && mkdir -p alembic_demo && cd alembic_demo && \\",
      "  alembic init alembic 2>&1 && \\",
      "  echo \"alembic 已初始化\"",
      "",
      "print(\"注意: alembic init 需要在一个空目录执行\")",
      "print(\"生产项目中，迁移脚本和代码一起版本控制\")"
    ]
  },
  {
    "cell_id": "cell-20",
    "cell_type": "markdown",
    "source": [
      "### Alembic 配置步骤",
      "",
      "Alembic 初始化后，需要做两件事：",
      "",
      "**1. 修改 `alembic.ini`：配置数据库连接**",
      "",
      "```ini",
      "sqlalchemy.url = postgresql+psycopg2://postgres:secret@localhost:5432/learn",
      "```",
      "",
      "**2. 修改 `alembic/env.py`：让 autogenerate 能找到你的模型**",
      "",
      "```python",
      "import sys",
      "sys.path.append('.')",
      "",
      "from myapp.models import Base  # 导入你的 Base",
      "target_metadata = Base.metadata",
      "```",
      "",
      "### 常用命令",
      "",
      "```bash",
      "# 生成迁移脚本（基于模型和当前数据库的差异）",
      "alembic revision --autogenerate -m \"add publisher table\"",
      "",
      "# 执行迁移到最新版本",
      "alembic upgrade head",
      "",
      "# 回滚一步",
      "alembic downgrade -1",
      "",
