      "---",
      "",
      "## Day 26：备份与恢复",
      "",
      "数据库的备份是**运维的底线**——没有备份，一次误操作就能让整个公司倒闭。",
      "",
      "### 备份工具",
      "",
      "| 工具 | 用途 | 命令 |",
      "|------|------|------|",
      "| `pg_dump` | 导出单个数据库 | `pg_dump -U postgres learn > backup.sql` |",
      "| `pg_dumpall` | 导出全部数据库+角色 | `pg_dumpall -U postgres > all.sql` |",
      "| `pg_restore` | 从自定义格式恢复 | `pg_restore -d learn backup.dump` |",
      "| `COPY` | 快速 CSV 导入导出 | `COPY t TO '/tmp/t.csv' CSV HEADER` |"
    ]
  },
  {
    "cell_id": "cell-24",
    "cell_type": "code",
    "source": [
      "# Day 26 练习：备份与恢复",
      "",
      "print(\"=== 1. 用 pg_dump 导出数据库 === \")",
      "!docker exec pg-learn pg_dump -U postgres -d learn --schema=bookstore --schema=shop --data-only --inserts -f /tmp/bookshop_data.sql 2>&1 || echo \"备份完成\"",
      "",
      "# 查看备份文件的前几行",
      "!docker exec pg-learn head -30 /tmp/bookshop_data.sql 2>/dev/null || echo \"备份为空或不存在\""
    ]
